                <l xml:id="m-023090cb-0d4a-48c7-b2dd-54d11c5c89bf" facs="#m-00b6a9a7-6ab2-4b84-a52b-b0cf86e621ff" label="text-like">Sunday at Compline.</l><l xml:id="m-a902c9f5-a3cd-4322-86eb-547c64efb98c" facs="#m-259b4769-e053-4bac-8c7e-3acf8096a6ef" label="ambiguous">273</l><l xml:id="m-5e451350-417f-4987-afe7-391adf007802" facs="#m-47d3ab6f-2fea-4b95-b86d-94547d1aa94b" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum. K. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-1e13acba-f4e4-4a8f-8bf8-86311c9e55d7" facs="#m-09d483b6-3941-4aff-9648-809b6282b010" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-c288f110-ce42-484b-b8b7-57eb47c35edc" facs="#m-42eef18c-a503-41c0-b244-a6b8ea80f488" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-d55c435b-24ef-44de-9f02-842b5ba5bf6f" facs="#m-c2282125-0849-410c-bbe0-6f218bf6328e" label="lyrics-like">(VIsita, quaésumus Dómine, habi- Per Dóminum nostrum Jesum Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-7db82d0b-1e54-413d-b638-94097a55603d" facs="#m-7c6b0936-ec0b-4447-a632-96ebd8102958" label="lyrics-like">tatiónem istam, et omnes insí¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba2886f0-374e-4ae4-9519-07810fdd6959" facs="#m-71781d12-7188-46fa-8f9b-b677aeeae9ec" label="ambiguous">stum Filium tuum:t qui tecum vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-46ad46b1-fe36-453d-8c8e-9365e8be00aa" facs="#m-48a12225-5285-4051-8bb9-3b5734366971" label="lyrics-like">dias inimíci ab ea longe repélle:</l><l xml:id="m-bcc4ea01-22c5-48a6-8c1b-efec123fc4c2" facs="#m-13168603-d65d-4fab-8f47-82bf9f246744" label="lyrics-like">vit et regnat in unitáte Spiritus</l><l xml:id="m-98ecb167-079c-4eff-bb79-e60a4630b4b2" facs="#m-69f33c51-9881-4c36-be53-ac1f91e1a012" label="lyrics-like">Angeli tui sancti hábitent in ea,</l><l xml:id="m-fd8fe621-3c41-4a24-a6a4-bda2e9c896f8" facs="#m-6f2becd1-4167-424e-8848-c590507e8cdc" label="lyrics-like">Sancti Deus, * per ómnia saécula</l><l xml:id="m-2d0954ad-644e-4323-bf59-225676909e01" facs="#m-c30e1907-b7d3-4a56-8b44-8f20f7172789" label="lyrics-like">saeculórum. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-8bec6ec3-ea10-4886-adbf-65572cf622cd" facs="#m-39cb5080-51a6-492f-b627-e3c21e21d4be" label="lyrics-like">qui nos in pace custódiant;“ et be¬</l><l xml:id="m-356c1b0c-49fa-40e0-b73f-1ba81c9b90d7" facs="#m-705a09b7-c92e-4b81-b532-bebf9e9b8532" label="lyrics-like">nedíctio tua sit super nos semper.</l><l xml:id="m-baf2ff20-e39d-482f-8ed4-118f7297ff06" facs="#m-7ab30911-e264-4cce-aacc-c96805a8795d" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobíscum. R. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-e59db5eb-cc15-4a61-9508-786a76d9890d" facs="#m-ac7d24fd-b9e6-4a85-bd38-0f75c387075f" label="lyrics-like">W. Benedi-cámus Dómino. K. Dé-o grá-ti-as.</l><l xml:id="m-7192114e-d95b-4ffb-94ef-366f505f33af" facs="#m-a40a4df0-0b1d-4adb-8e57-796ae9374e1c" label="text-like">Blessing (given by Oficiant recto tono, slowly and gravely.)</l><l xml:id="m-e7e5244a-807f-41df-8d9c-10fddb473e9e" facs="#m-885dd347-64bc-4e3a-b636-6f04f2e8ec9a" label="lyrics-like">Benedícat et custódiat nos omnípotens et miséricors Dóminus, Páter,</l><l xml:id="m-f793889f-5643-4417-bef5-081f618ba6b8" facs="#m-e34712de-816d-406d-b669-29fc4490a840" label="lyrics-like">et Filius, et Spiritus Sánctus. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-995ce6be-4ce3-4fcc-8af0-92ec209e4d82" facs="#m-09c50269-d97e-43de-a1f7-c9ef9cf6f92c" label="lyrics-like">The Y. Fidélium ánimae. is omitted, but one of the folloing Anthems is</l><l xml:id="m-c79b51b5-7a58-43c5-8e6a-f9cb177f687d" facs="#m-ae301189-f7cd-45ee-a3b3-0919c6fe966e" label="text-like">said according to the Season.</l><l xml:id="m-0c371989-8d1b-4819-ab52-ed649a7d2474" facs="#m-fb6fd116-d6c7-4ac2-9d71-c09283c624fe" label="text-like">From Vespers of Saturday before the Ist Sunday of Advent to and</l><l xml:id="m-cb9c7c80-03cd-4e42-b20d-b1190b169e2f" facs="#m-c467963a-0bf5-4118-b134-1f3657fca44f" label="text-like">Vespers of the Purification.</l><l xml:id="m-72ec2303-fdf2-4795-9f2f-2f3a54f17a16" facs="#m-61a6fea8-bf96-4e84-a538-e535642828a4" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-053bab75-801f-4e8c-855d-13f982422558" facs="#m-7bcd56e5-6c57-4f36-9dda-a979ad414735" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-692857dd-caa0-482b-821f-1fe8b4c7cf4e" facs="#m-48bb4da4-4f7a-406d-9bbd-1d9357f1ccc9" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-754d21a9-1ca5-4c17-bb57-518c7dd9fba0" facs="#m-3c376549-b284-4d10-b943-bdfcf3ec54dd" label="lyrics-like">ma “Redemptóris Má- ter, quae pér¬</l><l xml:id="m-b1e15bf6-575e-424c-9fc1-6e655aa70552" facs="#m-c32eabf3-e37a-4de6-9234-fb8796fa015f" label="lyrics-like">vi-a caéli pórta má-nes, Et stél- la má-ris, succúrre</l><l xml:id="m-c8aa1c97-da3a-4d59-94cd-f78b8fde1226" facs="#m-d5f3c6e9-57f5-489a-a465-30b1e4e6521d" label="lyrics-like">cadén-ti súrgere qui cú-rat pópu-lo: Tu quae genu-í¬</l><l xml:id="m-9d7b91e1-a43a-402f-9df5-28cc75853b44" facs="#m-58c5a65f-ba52-4193-a492-ecf744d31451" label="lyrics-like">sti, natú- ra mi-rán-te, tú-um sánctum Ge-ni-tórem:</l><l xml:id="m-6e59c951-8c3c-4862-aec1-7a647a6bf7a7" facs="#m-c7c01765-0504-42c5-b491-edcdfa953489" label="lyrics-like">ac posté-ri-us, Gabri-é-lis ab ó-re</l><l xml:id="m-9a68f932-1bd8-42b2-9f00-e0fb3d10a379" facs="#m-f06a05cf-bd13-493d-934c-e9f38bddbb9c" label="ambiguous">Vir- go pri¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb9b7886-121a-4d9e-abef-ced666bb0007" facs="#m-746aa459-4f31-42a8-9794-2f9397fa3b40" label="ambiguous">us</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>